OL,3,GNEWSASchool in 'outstanding' inclusion
OL,4,Arating first
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mainstream primary school has become
OL,7,Fthe first in the South West to receive
OL,8,Fan "outstanding" rating from Ofsted for
OL,9,Fits inclusion policies.
OL,11,FEmersons Green Primary, in Bristol, was
OL,12,Fgiven the rating for inclusion and it
OL,13,Falso achieved a "strong standard" in
OL,14,Fall other areas following an inspection
OL,15,Fin June.
OL,17,FInspectors said the school's inclusive
OL,18,Fculture was exceptional but they were
OL,19,Fmost impressed by pupils'
OL,20,F"understanding of the importance of
OL,21,Fincluding everyone".
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
