OL,3,GNEWSASchool in 'outstanding' inclusion
OL,4,Arating first
OL,5,
OL,6,FHeadteacher Soraya Young said: "Ofsted
OL,7,Frecognised that inclusion here isn't
OL,8,Fsomething that's added on - it's
OL,9,Fsomething built into the bones of the
OL,10,Fschool."
